{"seq":1,"slug":"dragdrop-a11y","title":"拖放可访问性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/practice/dragdrop-a11y","wordCount":1274,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"拖放可访问性\">拖放可访问性</h1><p>拖放有一个先天缺陷：它假定用户有一只能精确移动的手和一双能看见拖影的眼睛。但键盘用户没法「拖」，读屏用户看不到卡片在哪一列，运动障碍用户难以完成「按住—移动—松开」这一连串精细动作。原生 HTML5 拖放协议对这些用户几乎是一堵墙——它不产生任何辅助技术能理解的语义，键盘根本无法触发。如果你的看板、文件管理器、排序列表只能用鼠标拖，那就把相当一部分用户挡在了门外，在很多地区这还是合规问题。本篇讲如何让拖放对键盘和辅助技术可用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-拖放必须有非拖替代\">核心概念：拖放必须有非拖替代</h2><p>可访问拖放的第一原则不是「让拖放本身无障碍」，而是<strong>为每个拖放操作提供一条不依赖拖的等价路径</strong>。WCAG 2.2 的成功准则 2.5.7「拖动移动（Dragging Movements）」明确要求：任何用拖动完成的功能，都必须能用单指针（点击）替代——除非拖动是本质必需的。键盘可达则是更基础的 2.1.1「键盘」准则的要求。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一个拖放操作&lt;br/&gt;如: 卡片移到下一列] --&gt; B[鼠标路径&lt;br/&gt;拖拽]&#10;  A --&gt; C[键盘路径&lt;br/&gt;聚焦+方向键+回车]&#10;  A --&gt; D[点击路径&lt;br/&gt;菜单选移动到...]&#10;  B --&gt; E[屏幕阅读器&lt;br/&gt;ARIA live 播报状态]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[所有用户都能完成]\">flowchart TD\n  A[一个拖放操作&lt;br/&gt;如: 卡片移到下一列] --&gt; B[鼠标路径&lt;br/&gt;拖拽]\n  A --&gt; C[键盘路径&lt;br/&gt;聚焦+方向键+回车]\n  A --&gt; D[点击路径&lt;br/&gt;菜单选移动到...]\n  B --&gt; E[屏幕阅读器&lt;br/&gt;ARIA live 播报状态]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[所有用户都能完成]</pre><p>这张图的要义：同一个语义操作（移动卡片）必须同时有鼠标、键盘、点击三条入口，且无论走哪条，屏幕阅读器都能通过 ARIA live region 听到「拿起了卡片」「移到了进行中列」「放下完成」这样的实时播报。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>用户群体</th>\n<th>障碍</th>\n<th>可访问方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>键盘用户</td>\n<td>无法拖</td>\n<td>方向键移动 + 回车确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读屏用户</td>\n<td>看不到位置</td>\n<td>ARIA live 播报状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动障碍</td>\n<td>难完成按住拖动</td>\n<td>点击式「移动到…」菜单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低视力</td>\n<td>看不清拖影</td>\n<td>高对比焦点 + 大命中区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"键盘可操作的拖放\">键盘可操作的拖放</h2><p>键盘拖放的标准交互模式是「抓取—移动—放下」三态：聚焦到可拖项，按空格/回车「抓取」（进入拖动模式），用方向键在候选位置间移动，再按空格/回车「放下」，Esc 取消。实现上要给可拖项加 <code>tabindex=&quot;0&quot;</code> 让它可聚焦，并监听键盘。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"let grabbed = null;&#10;&#10;list.addEventListener(&#39;keydown&#39;, (e) =&gt; {&#10;  const item = e.target.closest(&#39;[data-draggable]&#39;);&#10;  if (!item) return;&#10;&#10;  if (e.key === &#39; &#39; || e.key === &#39;Enter&#39;) {&#10;    e.preventDefault();&#10;    if (!grabbed) {&#10;      grabbed = item;&#10;      announce(`已抓取 ${item.textContent}，用方向键移动`);&#10;    } else {&#10;      announce(`已放下 ${grabbed.textContent}`);&#10;      grabbed = null;&#10;    }&#10;  } else if (grabbed &amp;&amp; (e.key === &#39;ArrowDown&#39; || e.key === &#39;ArrowUp&#39;)) {&#10;    e.preventDefault();&#10;    moveItem(grabbed, e.key === &#39;ArrowDown&#39; ? 1 : -1);&#10;    announce(`移动到第 ${indexOf(grabbed) + 1} 位`);&#10;  } else if (e.key === &#39;Escape&#39; &amp;&amp; grabbed) {&#10;    announce(&#39;已取消&#39;);&#10;    grabbed = null;&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grabbed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'keydown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.target.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">closest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[data-draggable]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">item) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e.key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ' '</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Enter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">preventDefault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grabbed) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      grabbed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      announce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`已抓取 ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">item</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">textContent</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}，用方向键移动`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      announce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`已放下 ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grabbed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">textContent</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      grabbed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (grabbed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e.key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ArrowDown'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ArrowUp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">preventDefault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    moveItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(grabbed, e.key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ArrowDown'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    announce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`移动到第 ${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">indexOf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grabbed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 位`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e.key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Escape'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grabbed) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    announce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'已取消'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    grabbed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>tabindex</code>、焦点管理、键盘交互模式是可访问组件的通用基础，系统讲解归<a href=\"../../web-accessibility/aria/keyboard-focus\">键盘与焦点管理</a>；本篇聚焦它在拖放语境的具体落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"aria-live-region-让操作-可听见\">ARIA live region：让操作「可听见」</h2><p>视障用户感知不到视觉上的拖影和让位动画，必须靠 ARIA live region 把每一步状态用文字播报出来。做法是放一个屏幕外的 <code>aria-live</code> 容器，在抓取、移动、放下、取消时往里写描述文本，屏幕阅读器会自动朗读。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;div id=&quot;dnd-live&quot; aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; class=&quot;sr-only&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dnd-live\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-live</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"assertive\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sr-only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function announce(message) {&#10;  const live = document.getElementById(&#39;dnd-live&#39;);&#10;  live.textContent = &#39;&#39;; // 先清空，确保相同文本也会重新播报&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(() =&gt; {&#10;    live.textContent = message;&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> announce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> live</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dnd-live'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  live.textContent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 先清空，确保相同文本也会重新播报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    live.textContent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> message;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个细节决定播报是否好用：其一，拖动状态变化用 <code>aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot;</code>（打断当前朗读，立即通报），而非 <code>polite</code>；其二，先清空再写入，否则连续两次相同文本（如重复按方向键）屏幕阅读器可能不重读。ARIA live region 的更深机制见<a href=\"../../web-accessibility/perception/screen-readers\">屏幕阅读器</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么主流库把-a11y-做进内核\">为什么主流库把 a11y 做进内核</h2><p>手写上面这套——键盘三态机、焦点恢复、live 播报、与鼠标拖放的状态同步——既繁琐又极易在边界条件出错。这正是 2026 年主流拖放库的核心卖点之一。如<a href=\"../dragdrop/custom-drag-interactions\">自定义拖放交互</a>所述，dnd-kit 把 ARIA live 播报和键盘传感器做进了内核，开箱就有可访问的键盘拖放；Atlassian 的 Pragmatic drag-and-drop 也提供基于其设计系统的默认辅助控件。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>手写成本</th>\n<th>dnd-kit</th>\n<th>Pragmatic DnD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>键盘拖放</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>内建（键盘传感器）</td>\n<td>内建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARIA live 播报</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>内建、可定制文案</td>\n<td>内建默认控件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焦点恢复</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>内建</td>\n<td>内建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义文案</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结论很实际：除非需求极简，可访问拖放应当用库而非手写——把容易出错的 a11y 逻辑交给经过打磨的实现。即便用库，也别忘了补一条「点击式移动菜单」作为最稳的降级，它对运动障碍用户尤其友好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可访问拖放的第一原则是为每个拖放操作提供非拖替代（键盘、点击），而非让拖动本身无障碍；WCAG 2.2 的 2.5.7 与 2.1.1 是硬约束。</li>\n<li>键盘拖放用「抓取—方向键移动—放下，Esc 取消」三态机；可拖项需 <code>tabindex=&quot;0&quot;</code> 可聚焦。</li>\n<li>视障用户靠 ARIA live region 听状态：用 <code>assertive</code> 即时播报，先清空再写入以确保重复文本也朗读。</li>\n<li>手写这套 a11y 逻辑繁琐易错，2026 年 dnd-kit、Pragmatic DnD 都把键盘与 live 播报做进内核——可访问拖放应优先用库。</li>\n<li>始终补一条点击式「移动到…」菜单作为最稳降级，对运动障碍用户尤其重要。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"cross-browser-clipboard\">跨浏览器兼容</a> — 可访问性之外，落地拖放/剪贴板的另一类工程约束。</li>\n<li>拖放章：<a href=\"../dragdrop/custom-drag-interactions\">自定义拖放交互</a> — 为何用库能直接获得可访问的键盘拖放。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../web-accessibility/aria/keyboard-focus\">键盘与焦点管理</a> — <code>tabindex</code>、焦点、键盘交互的通用基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拖放可访问性","id":"拖放可访问性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：拖放必须有非拖替代","id":"核心概念-拖放必须有非拖替代"},{"level":2,"text":"键盘可操作的拖放","id":"键盘可操作的拖放"},{"level":2,"text":"ARIA live region：让操作「可听见」","id":"aria-live-region-让操作-可听见"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么主流库把 a11y 做进内核","id":"为什么主流库把-a11y-做进内核"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"自定义拖放交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/dragdrop/custom-drag-interactions"},"next":{"title":"跨浏览器兼容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/practice/cross-browser-clipboard"}}